{"unit_id":"cfanzx__dsh-compact-relay#feature-1","repo":"cfanzx/dsh-compact-relay","commit":"ad0c3c0a043af4cca24e1dbc36a96ec1871adc53","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compact-relay 的功能「预览并压缩」：先计算可压缩范围与释放容量，再由用户确认执行压缩，将较早历史替换为摘要。通过 /bc 预览、/bc confirm 执行。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/adapters/commands.js:53","lib/actions/better-compact.js:264"]}
