{"unit_id":"cfanzx__dsh-compact-relay#feature-3","repo":"cfanzx/dsh-compact-relay","commit":"ad0c3c0a043af4cca24e1dbc36a96ec1871adc53","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compact-relay 的功能「锁定消息」：用户可锁定最近一轮或从候选列表选择消息；被锁定的消息在后续压缩时跳过。使用 /pin 管理锁定，/unpin 清除锁定。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/actions/pin.js:67","lib/actions/pin.js:110","lib/actions/pin.js:134"]}
{"unit_id":"cfanzx__dsh-compact-relay#feature-4","repo":"cfanzx/dsh-compact-relay","commit":"ad0c3c0a043af4cca24e1dbc36a96ec1871adc53","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compact-relay 的功能「收藏消息」：可收藏会话中的消息、列出收藏、读取原文或取消收藏，并可查看系统给出的收藏建议。通过 /favorite 命令及其子命令触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/adapters/commands.js:193","lib/actions/favorite.js:202","lib/actions/favorite.js:415"]}
{"unit_id":"cfanzx__dsh-compact-relay#caveat-1","repo":"cfanzx/dsh-compact-relay","commit":"ad0c3c0a043af4cca24e1dbc36a96ec1871adc53","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compact-relay 使用前须知：功能依赖 DSH 提供的会话、工具、命令和 systemPrompt 等宿主服务，并面向 Web composer；状态和交接文档写入本机目录，不提供会话外部同步。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:20","lib/index.js:23"]}
